      "explanation": "RC2 was met: the doctor framed the illness as influenza/pneumonia-related pulmonary infection with dyspnea needing respiratory-specialty inpatient monitoring, and repeatedly warned that temporary oxygenation or lack of rescue did not mean safety.",
