          "explanation": "The doctor explained current medication categories in patient-understandable terms.",
          "quote": "头孢曲松是常用的抗生素"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_01008",
          "explanation": "The doctor reinforced not self-changing oxygen or medications.",
          "quote": "不自行调氧、不乱改药"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the doctor gave a bounded explanation that antibiotics, oxygen, expectorant/nebulization were reasonable inpatient categories while requiring ward-team verification and repeatedly warned the family not to change oxygen or medications themselves.",
