          "quote": "护士刚来要推床去呼吸科了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00089",
          "explanation": "The doctor gave post-arrival questions but did not confirm oxygen/monitoring/escort needs for the transport itself.",
          "quote": "请您到呼吸科后，重点问医生以下几句话"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 had a minor/moderate in-chain error: the doctor treated respiratory transfer as continued care and later supported handoff, but at the active bed-move moment did not explicitly confirm oxygen continuation, monitoring/infusion needs, or responsible escort before transport. This was an authored transfer-safety duty; the error is not graded serious because the transfer was nurse-led and later evidence showed the patient arrived on oxygen/monitoring without deterioration.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
