        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00956",
          "explanation": "The doctor confirmed a family handoff script and understanding.",
          "quote": "您已经把‘暂时稳住但仍有风险’这个核心说清楚了"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the doctor gave owners, timing, fallback escalation, and repeatedly obtained family teach-back/receipt for what to ask, what to watch, and when to call staff.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
